{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12203620","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12203620","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1220362001:1":{"text":"タークさん！元気ですか？ソニアさんから新しい仕事を任されたそうじゃないですか。","source_cn":"塔克！你还好吗？听说索尼娅给你安排了新的工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x937A79529588FE3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220362002:1":{"text":"実は、事情を知った若頭が、新たな仕事を手配するようボスに頼んでくれたんだ。","source_cn":"其实是卢卡二当家得知了事情的经过，他去拜托大当家给我安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD6F9C1CD78C578C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220362003:1":{"text":"ボスはラスティーアンカーの浮浪児を保護したいと考えていて、孤児院の創設を計画中でな。それを俺が手伝うことになったんだ。","source_cn":"大当家想要好好保护在锈锚港流浪的孩子，她正在筹办孤儿院...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A4DC022A9C10618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220362004:1":{"text":"わぁ、この大きな鍋の料理をひとりで作ったのですか？おいしいそう……","source_cn":"哇，这一大锅都是你做的？看着不错嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA1D7E545B71EAB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220362005:1":{"text":"実際、腕は良くないんだけどな。幸い、この子たちは好き嫌いしないから。","source_cn":"其实我的手艺不怎么样，幸好这些孩子不挑食。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C23AF5E009B2EA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220362006:0":{"text":"そこの後ろに、孤児院が建てられるのですか？","source_cn":"你身后这地方，以后就是孤儿院了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA11C9484C5F7FFBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220362007:1":{"text":"いや、場所はまだ決まってない。子どもたちもしばらくはテント暮らしだ。まぁ、自立を助けるのも俺の仕事だからな。","source_cn":"孤儿院的选址还没定，孩子们暂时只能住在帐篷里。光是有个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BA8D99A52BF3549","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220362008:1":{"text":"飯を与えるだけじゃなくて、サバイバルスキルも教えるようにボスからは言われてる。","source_cn":"除了给他们做饭，大当家还让我教他们一些生存技巧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7601F99895195779","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220362009:0":{"text":"自分たちだけで生きていけるようにならなければ、彼らが大きくなってここを出たとき、海の藻屑となってしまう。","source_cn":"只要能够靠自己生活下去，等他们长大，也就不再是海中漂泊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x488EF38EE7E17232","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220362010:1":{"text":"子どもが好きなんですね。娘さんがいましたよね、会いに戻ろうとは思わないのですか？","source_cn":"你好像很喜欢小孩子。我知道你有一个女儿，你想过回去见她吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C36E552A21B785","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220362011:1":{"text":"いや……合わせる顔がないよ。少なくとも今はな。","source_cn":"我……我没脸见她。起码现在还没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12F48D10EBEB7918","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220362012:1":{"text":"でも、毎日のように子どもたちと向き合うことで、少しずつ自分も成長してる気がするんだ。","source_cn":"现在每天和孩子们相处，我感觉自己的腰杆一点点直了起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28163EB8E03FD5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220362013:0":{"text":"こうして何年も経てば、またリリーに会いに行く勇気が持てるかもな。","source_cn":"说不定，在很多年以后，我会有勇气回去见莉莉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10242F9CD1415FFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220362014:1":{"text":"リリーに会ったら、またあの女の子を思い出すんだろうな……","source_cn":"见到莉莉，我一定又会想起那个小姑娘吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x203BDFC2AF035E4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220362015:1":{"text":"きっとあの子は美しい場所にたどり着いたはずです。あなたも良い人生を送って、彼女を心配させないでくださいね。","source_cn":"她一定去了很美的地方，你也要好好生活，别让她担心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335C0795406B15B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1220362016:1":{"text":"ありがとな、小さな使い魔。","source_cn":"谢谢你，小使魔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF711E20704BF72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220362017:0":{"text":"それにしても……今日は日差しが暖かいな。","source_cn":"话说回来……今天的太阳很暖和啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DB80B95D683E1D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220362018:1":{"text":"彼女もこの暖かな日差しを楽しんでるかな？もしそうなら……嬉しいんだけど。","source_cn":"也不知道她现在能不能享受到这份阳光？要是能……那就太好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA35D9A4D764B697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:箱子·塔克":{"text":"ターク","source":"箱子·塔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":3}}